#: src/components/WooCommerceSettings.jsx:29
msgid "Disable cart fragments"
msgstr ""

#: src/components/WooCommerceSettings.jsx:33
msgid "Stops the AJAX cart-fragments request (?wc-ajax=get_refreshed_fragments) everywhere except the cart and checkout. The single biggest WooCommerce speed win, and it lets full-page caching work. Trade-off: Add to Cart still works, but a cart counter in your header will not update until the next page load."
msgstr ""

#: src/components/WooCommerceSettings.jsx:40
msgid "Disable scripts & styles on non-store pages"
msgstr ""

#: src/components/WooCommerceSettings.jsx:44
msgid "Drops WooCommerce CSS and woocommerce.min.js on pages with no store content — shop, product, cart, checkout and account pages are always left alone, as are pages embedding a WooCommerce block or shortcode. The Add to Cart handler is never removed. If a page builder renders products through its own shortcode and its styling looks wrong, return true from the spfw_is_woo_page filter for that page."
msgstr ""

#: src/components/WooCommerceSettings.jsx:55
msgid "Dequeues the WooCommerce password-strength-meter script on account and checkout forms."
msgstr ""

